      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Bandana is located in northern Ballard County at the intersection of Kentucky Route 358 (Bandana Road) and Kentucky Route 473 (Needmore Road / Woodville Road).",
